{%- comment -%}
Paste this into the "Quadrant" tab of the lunch-lerum plugin's Edit
Markup screen (separate from the "Full" tab's template.liquid). Compact
version   for small Mashup panes - just today's lunch, no forecast table.

Sizing note: value--large (58px) overflows a Quadrant pane (~1/4 screen);
use value--small here instead, matching the fix applied to weather-yr.

Bug fix: this used to check ONLY today.lunch, so on a day where only
"Dagens Gröna" (vegetarian) was published (today.lunch is null), it fell
through all the way to the "No lunch info" fallback even though a valid
dish existed. Now it shows whichever of the two is actually available,
preferring Lunch when both exist (Full view shows both side by side;
Quadrant only has room for one).

Weekend note: skolmat never has data on Lördag/Söndag, so on weekends
this pane shows the hemmamat (home food) dish instead of the generic
"HELG !!" text - more useful in this small a space than a message
that's just explaining an absence. Full view still shows both
"Skolmatn:"/"Hemmamatn:" sections stacked; there's only room for one here.

"Dagens kock" (right column): unrelated in content to the lunch data -
it's today's random pick from the broforce plugin's own portrait roster
(see fetch.mjs's pickDagensKock()), shown picture-then-name exactly like
broforce/template.quadrant.liquid does for its own Bro of the day
("image image--contain image-dither", same max-height, plain label below,
no description - description is only shown in broforce's own Full view).
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--row gap--large">
  <div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--xsmall" style="flex: 1;">
    {% if today.lunch %}
    <div class="label">Dagens Lunch</div>
    <div class="value value--small" style="text-align: center;">{{ today.lunch | truncate: 40 }}</div>
    <img class="image" src="{{ today.lunch_icon_url }}" width="32" height="32" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;">
    {% elsif today.vegetarian %}
    <div class="label">Dagens Gröna</div>
    <div class="value value--small" style="text-align: center;">{{ today.vegetarian | truncate: 40 }}</div>
    <img class="image" src="{{ today.vegetarian_icon_url }}" width="32" height="32" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;">
    {% elsif today.hemmamat %}
    <div class="label">Hemmamat {{ today.weekday }}</div>
    <div class="value value--small" style="text-align: center;">{{ today.hemmamat.lunch | truncate: 40 }}</div>
    {% elsif today.note %}
    <div class="label">{{ today.weekday }}</div>
    <div class="value">{{ today.note }}</div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="value">No lunch info</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {% if today.dagens_kock %}
  <div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--xsmall" style="flex: 1;">
    <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ today.dagens_kock.image_url }}" style="max-height: 75%;">
    <div class="label">{{ today.dagens_kock.name }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">Matn</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>